    {
      "version": "2.0.0",
      "tagName": "v2.0.0",
      "releaseDate": "2026-10-23T04:44:46.680Z",
      "notesSummary": "Ritemark turns a folder on your computer into a workspace where ChatGPT or Claude work with you. Ritemark 2.0 is a new Ritemark. The window has a calm new frame, in light and dark, on the Mac and on Windows. The first start is a welcome that asks which AI you use and opens your project with it ready. And your project is at the centre: each project has its own Home and its own tasks, and you switch between projects in the same window. Underneath, Ritemark runs on a newer VS Code. Everything Ritemark 1.14 did is still here, though some of it has moved. [Updating from 1.14](#updating-from-114) says where.",
